{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T09:53:18.948220Z","id":"8bc1aac3367efbfd63aaa66953affdf0558c1d208d496f3fc639294ca77cbe1b","body":{"detail":"The eager bridge measured 5547 against 5548 before; taking the shell's origin from the bridge tag (web/bridge/src/bridge.ts, shellOrigins(script?.dataset.origin || location.href)) costs 6 gzip bytes in its smallest form tried. Raising a budget is the owner's call: the other way is to cut as many bytes elsewhere in the eager bridge.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":6},"end":{"line":6},"content_hash":"9722c601021c589bc5a14c79ae5d413ba9bee8d1248cb107de23f5d40dde1efd"},"summary":"The eager bridge's budget was raised 5 gzip bytes (5548 to 5553) for the content origin's data-origin","tags":["web","status:needs-decision","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
