{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/perf/bundle-budget.json","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T10:20:28.276261Z","id":"f87b6345eea80b6081e4b738d71a37d1c24e23da6ca02a80097a16d228b92af5","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:6f89bac5","summary":"The eager bridge is back within 5548: calling PickFlow.start directly (dropping the one-line pick wrapper in web/bridge/src/bridge.ts) saves 12 gzip bytes. Evidence: cd web && npx vite build -c vite.bridge.config.ts && node scripts/bundle-size.mjs prints eager bridge 5541, budget 5548; npx vitest run bridge: 260 passed.","supersedes":"8bc1aac3367efbfd63aaa66953affdf0558c1d208d496f3fc639294ca77cbe1b","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
